# helpers-default.config — tflw `M239` `D` (`D1279`): `C119` (`config:directive:helpers`).
#
# No `helpers` line, so the two defaults apply — `./helpers` and `./tests/helpers`. Its control is
# `helpers-lib.config`, which is this file plus one line naming `./lib` instead. The corpus is
# `uses-helpers.tflw` and `uses-lib.tflw`, each `use`ing a real module beside it; which of the
# two is `TF083` swaps between the two configs, over unchanged files.

env local default
  api "http://localhost:9/v1"
